# This repository versions ONLY the game-re reverse-engineering agent system.
# Everything else in ~/.claude (credentials, sessions, memory, settings,
# history) is private runtime state and must never be tracked.
#
# Whitelist pattern: ignore everything, then opt in specific paths.

/*

!/.gitignore
!/README.md

!/agents
/agents/*
!/agents/game-re.md
!/agents/game-re-lessons
!/agents/game-re-tooling
# ...but not the third-party reference mirrors kept alongside the authored
# tooling notes. fullsnes.txt (nocash's SNES specs, extracted from no$sns)
# and genesis-reference/ (Exodus techdocs, Plutiedev/Kabuto hardware notes)
# are other people's copyrighted documentation, mirrored locally for offline
# lookup -- versioning them here would be redistribution. snes.md and
# genesis.md reference them by path; on a fresh clone those references are
# dangling until the files are fetched again from their upstreams.
/agents/game-re-tooling/fullsnes.txt
/agents/game-re-tooling/genesis-reference/
!/agents/explorer.md
!/agents/reviewer.md

!/skills
/skills/*
!/skills/re-codebreaker
!/skills/re-oracle
!/skills/re-learn
!/skills/ira-disasm
!/skills/radare2-amiga
!/skills/seer-website
